 ("What makes an election free and fair?",["Independent Election Commission","Equal vote for all","Rules against misuse"],["Thinking the winner needs over half the votes"]),
 ["Elections let people choose representatives.","FPTP: most votes wins.","The Election Commission conducts elections.","Voters should be informed."],
