  ("Waves are caused by wind. Tides are the rise and fall of sea level due to the pull of the Moon and the Sun.","waves and tides"),
  ("Ocean currents are streams of water moving in definite directions. They affect climate and fishing.","currents"),
  ("A country's maritime zones include the territorial sea up to 12 nautical miles and the exclusive economic zone up to 200 nautical miles.","maritime zones"),
