 ("What helped communities be resilient in this period?",["Alliances and forts","Bhakti and Sufi ideas","Trade and agriculture"],["Thinking the period was only about wars"]),
 ["Rulers resisted through forts and alliances.","The Bhakti tradition built solidarity.","Agriculture and trade kept the economy strong.","Culture blended and grew."],
